<title>UK: Robert Wiseman dairy merger referred to MMC.</title>
<headline>Robert Wiseman dairy merger referred to MMC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proposed merger of Robert Wiseman Dairies Plc and Scottish Pride Holdings Plc has been referred to the UK's Monopolies and Mergers Commission (MMC), the Department of Trade (DTI) said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The merger has been referred because of competition concerns over the processing and wholesale supply of milk in Scotland,&quot; the DTI said in a statement.</p>
<p>The MMC is required to make their report by 29 November.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
